---
// Astro 组件脚本（类似 Vue 的 script setup）
// 这里可以放 JS 逻辑，但当前页面纯静态，不需要
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>HConzlvra_ 的主页</title>
    <style>
      /* 全局样式 */
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0c29, #302b63, #24243e);
        color: #e0e0e0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 2rem 1rem;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 1000px;
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }
      
      /* Hero 区域 */
      .hero {
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
      }
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb, #f5576c);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      .hero .subtitle {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: #c8b6ff;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }
      .hero .tagline {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        color: #a0a0b8;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .hero .actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1rem;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .hero .actions a {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.8rem 2.2rem;
        border-radius: 40px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
      .hero .actions .btn-primary {
        background: #f093fb;
        color: #1a1a2e;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(240, 147, 251, 0.3);
      }
      .hero .actions .btn-primary:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(240, 147, 251, 0.5);
        background: #f5576c;
        color: #fff;
      }
      .hero .actions .btn-secondary {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        color: #c8b6ff;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      }
      .hero .actions .btn-secondary:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      }

      /* Features 区域 */
      .features {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }
      .features .card {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
      }
      .features .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      }
      .features .card h3 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb, #f5576c);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
      }
      .features .card p {
        color: #b0b0c8;
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      /* 响应式 */
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .hero h1 {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
        }
        .hero .subtitle {
          font-size: 1.3rem;
        }
        .hero .tagline {
          font-size: 1rem;
          white-space: normal;
        }
        .hero .actions {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: center;
        }
        .features {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <!-- Hero -->
      <section class="hero">
        <h1>Hi !  Here's HConzlvra_</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">你好！这里是哈康HC</p>
        <p class="tagline">「我让自己登基，做疯的君王｜万物皆有裂痕，那是光照进来的地方」</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a href="https://github.com/HConzlvra" class="btn-primary">HC's Github Page</a>
          <a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3493291423172656" class="btn-secondary">HC's Bilibili Page</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Features -->
      <section class="features">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>由 Astro 搭建</h3>
          <p>不知道</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>是个人物</h3>
          <p>烨然若神人</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>哈康大会@Official</h3>
          <p>Harold_Conzlvra, HConzlvra_, HC, 哈康, 哈康HC, 哈康国王～</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>